        <headline>REPEAT ITEM TRACKING</headline>
        <description>BACKGROUND:
 Multiple reports of a blocked RH aft (lav. E) toilet or that does not flush or does not stop to flush.
 
 ACTION:
 1. Obey safety precautions and get access to the aircraft.
  
 2. Replace the flush valve of the RH aft (lav. E) toilet. Refer to AMM 38-32-01-000-808-001 and 38-32-01-400-808-001.
 NOTE 
 
 
 Be careful when you tighten the nuts that attach the flush valve with the flange on the toilet elbow and support bracket.
 This step complies with TT 38-007.
 
 
  
 3. Record all findings in this workorder.
  
 4. Return the aircraft to a serviceable condition.</description>
